@startuml 017-suite-mocking-pattern
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadownding false

title Automated Validation Layer - Mocking and Interception Pattern

box "Pytest Engine Framework" #White
participant "Test Case Runner\n(test_client_http.py)" as Test
participant "MagicMock Context\n(requests.Session.post)" as Mock
end box

box "Isolated Source Code Modules" #White
participant "AdriaHTTPClient\n(http_client.py)" as HTTP
end box

Test -> Mock: Interpose patch decorator & inject fake JSON response\n(status_code=404, json={"error": "File not found."})
Test -> HTTP: invoke get_download_plan("/missing.txt")
activate HTTP

HTTP -> Mock: execution call post()
note over Mock: Interception interceptor triggers.\nZero traffic reaches the internet or Flask wire.
Mock --> HTTP: deliver return_value (Mocked 404 response payload)

HTTP -> HTTP: evaluate response.ok -> Hit False state
HTTP -> HTTP: parse custom JSON message -> raise BackendServerError
Test <-- HTTP: raise BackendServerError Exception
deactivate HTTP

Test -> Test: assert pytest.raises(BackendServerError) matched successfully
note over Test #LightGreen: Test Checkpoint PASSED\nExecution Time: ~0.002s
@enduml

